@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p class="lead">
    <strong>Furever Home</strong> is a pet adoption platform dedicated to connecting rescued animals
    with loving and responsible families. We work with animal shelters, rescue groups, and foster
    networks to help ensure every adoptable pet finds a permanent and caring home.
</p>

<p>
    Our platform focuses on making the adoption process easier, more transparent, and more accessible
    for everyone—with just a few clicks—so more animals can move from rescue situations into their
    <strong>forever homes</strong>.
</p>

<hr class="my-4">
<h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">Our Mission</h4>

<p class="mb-0">
    To make pet adoption easier and more accessible for everyone—with just a few clicks.
</p>
